<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Heritage AI</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Explore Indian heritage monuments and historical timelines decoded by AI.">
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      background-color: #060a12;
      color: #ffffff;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 16px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .wrapper {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .navbar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 12px 0;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .logo-icon {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    .logo-text {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ff9900;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background-color: #ff9900;
      color: #000000;
      border: none;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .hero-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      border: 1px solid #ff990040;
      background-color: #1a1200;
      color: #ffb74d;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 34px;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .highlight {
      color: #ffb74d;
    }
    .hero-subtitle {
      color: #9aa0a6;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .search-box {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .search-box input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 16px 55px 16px 18px;
      background-color: #0d1322;
      border: 1px solid #1e293b;
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 14px;
      outline: none;
    }
    .action-btn {
      position: absolute;
      right: 6px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      background-color: #ff9900;
      border: none;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      color: #38bdf8;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 40px 0 24px 0;
    }
    .monuments-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .monument-card {
      background-color: #0f172a;
      border: 1px solid #1e293b;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .monument-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 140px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .monument-card .card-caption {
      padding: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      background-color: #0f172a;
    }
    .timeline {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }
    .timeline::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 7px;
      top: 10px;
      bottom: 10px;
      width: 2px;
      background-color: #0284c7;
    }
    .timeline-item {
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .timeline-item:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .timeline-dot {
      position: absolute;
      left: -24px;
      top: 18px;
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #38bdf8;
      border: 3px solid #060a12;
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px #38bdf8;
    }
    .timeline-content {
      background-color: #0f172a;
      border: 1px solid #1e293b;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .timeline-date {
      color: #0284c7;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .timeline-heading {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .timeline-text {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <header class="navbar">
      <div class="logo">
        <span class="logo-icon">🏛️</span>
        <span class="logo-text">Heritage AI</span>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-primary">Explore India</button>
    </header>

    <main class="hero-container">
      <div class="badge">
        <span>✨ INDIA HERITAGE HUB ACTIVE</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        The World's <span class="highlight">History</span>,<br>
        Decoded by <span class="highlight">AI</span>.
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Don't just look at history—interact with it. Ask questions, slide through centuries with TimeLens, and discover thousands of monuments across India.
      </p>

      <div class="search-box">
        <input type="text" value="Ask Heritage AI... 'What did the Red Fort look like?'" readonly>
        <button class="action-btn">⚡</button>
      </div>
    </main>

    <h2 class="section-title">Heritage Monuments</h2>
    <div class="monuments-grid">
      <div class="monument-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564507592333-c60657eea523?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Taj Mahal, Agra">
        <div class="card-caption">Taj Mahal, Agra</div>
      </div>
      <div class="monument-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599661046289-e31897846e41?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Amer Fort, Jaipur">
        <div class="card-caption">Amer Fort, Jaipur</div>
      </div>
      <div class="monument-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587474260584-136574528ed5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="India Gate, Delhi">
        <div class="card-caption">India Gate, Delhi</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-title">Historical Timeline</h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <div class="timeline-date">1632 AD</div>
          <div class="timeline-heading">Ancient Architectural Era</div>
          <div class="timeline-text">
            Foundation of iconic heritage monuments built with intricate marble and red sandstone craftsmanship.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <div class="timeline-date">1983 AD</div>
          <div class="timeline-heading">UNESCO World Heritage Recognition</div>
          <div class="timeline-text">
            Major Indian monuments officially declared UNESCO World Heritage Sites for cultural preservation.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
        <div class="timeline-content">
          <div class="timeline-date">2026 (Present)</div>
          <div class="timeline-heading">Digital Heritage Archiving</div>
          <div class="timeline-text">
            Implementing modern web technologies and 3D modeling to preserve heritage globally for future generations.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
